<section class="pt-10 pb-20 sm:pt-16 sm:pb-24" aria-labelledby="intro">
  <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-medium text-accent-ink">Senior Software Engineer · Ottawa</p>
  <h1 id="intro" class="max-w-3xl text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-5xl">
    I build software people rely on every day, from delivery apps to search engines.
  </h1>
  <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-2 text-pretty">
    Full-stack web and mobile apps, data pipelines, search and machine learning. My thesis at the
    University of Ottawa was on machine learning for social-media geolocation, and I also run a
    real-estate practice on software I wrote.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
    <%= link_to "See my work", "#work", class: "rounded-lg bg-ink px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-paper hover:opacity-90" %>
    <%= link_to "GitHub", "https://github.com/mertmetin", class: "rounded-lg border border-line px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-tint", rel: "me" %>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="work" class="scroll-mt-8" aria-labelledby="work-heading">
  <h2 id="work-heading" class="mb-6 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-3">Selected work</h2>
  <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
    <% @projects.each do |project| %>
      <%= link_to project_path(project), class: "group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-ink-3 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-accent" do %>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight"><%= project.name %></h3>
          <span class="shrink-0 text-xs text-ink-3"><%= project.year %></span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-1 text-ink-2"><%= project.tagline %></p>
        <div class="mt-6">
          <p class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight tabular-nums"><%= project.stat %></p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink-3"><%= project.stat_label %></p>
        </div>
        <ul class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5" aria-label="Technologies">
          <% project.stack.first(5).each do |tech| %>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-tint px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-ink-2"><%= tech %></li>
          <% end %>
        </ul>
        <span class="mt-6 text-sm font-medium text-accent-ink">Read more <span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5">→</span></span>
      <% end %>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about" class="scroll-mt-8 pt-24" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr]">
    <h2 id="about-heading" class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-3">About</h2>
    <div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
      <p>
        I like taking a product from an empty repo to something real people use: designing the data
        model, building the API and the apps on top of it, wiring up payments and notifications, and
        deploying it all to the cloud with tests and CI behind it.
      </p>
      <p>
        I also care about measuring whether things actually work. When I revisited my 2014 product search
        and my 2019 thesis, the most useful thing I did was set up honest evaluations, which turned up
        bugs, models that had never learned anything, and an "upgrade" that made results worse.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm open to <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">senior software engineering</strong> and
        <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">ML / AI engineering</strong> roles in Ottawa or remote.
      </p>
      <p>
        <%= link_to "github.com/mertmetin", "https://github.com/mertmetin", class: "font-medium text-accent-ink underline underline-offset-4", rel: "me" %>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
